<title>USA: Innotech stake raised by Gabelli group.</title>
<headline>Innotech stake raised by Gabelli group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by New York investment manager Mario Gabelli said Friday it raised its stake in Innotech Inc to 674,200 common shares or 7.53 percent.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said its latest transactions include the purchase of 91,200 common shares on March 5 at a price of $13.6562 per share.</p>
<p>Innotech is a maker of systems that can customize prescription lenses for eyeglass retailers.</p>
</text>
